  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Developmen project of a training center and strengthenin g Kombit Fanm Kaskad- Dubreuil, KOFAKAD.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kombit Fanm Kaskad-Dubreuil (KOFAKAD), $17,825 over six months KOFAKAD will install a corn mill and sell milling services to farmers and merchants in Kaskad-Dubreuil in order to generate revenue to defray recurring costs of running the training center. The cost of construction will be financed by a small grant from the Haiti Fund at the Boston Foundation, and in-kind participation will be given by KOFAKAD. 18</narrative>
  </description>
